1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,380
Mr. Lu, are you all right?

2
00:00:05,080 --> 00:00:06,400
What am I doing next?

3
00:00:06,620 --> 00:00:07,420
Break it down!

4
00:00:07,440 --> 00:00:08,280
Come on, think.

5
00:00:14,880 --> 00:00:17,700
They probably hid in here after breaking the window,

6
00:00:18,340 --> 00:00:19,980
waited, and snuck out.

7
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:39,000
Secure the room right now.

8
00:00:39,480 --> 00:00:40,260
I'll report in.

9
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:06,680
Damn it, what do I do now?

10
00:01:16,680 --> 00:01:18,420
Check the security footage.

11
00:01:18,980 --> 00:01:19,580
Right.

12
00:01:23,660 --> 00:01:25,660
What the hell happened here?

13
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:32,260
He's gone.

14
00:01:32,960 --> 00:01:33,660
Call on the team.

15
00:01:35,660 --> 00:01:37,680
We need to secure the area.

16
00:01:44,720 --> 00:01:46,340
Uh, can I use your phone?

17
00:01:46,800 --> 00:01:47,560
Mine's dead.

18
00:01:48,540 --> 00:01:49,180
Idiot.

19
00:01:49,540 --> 00:01:51,140
It's your job to keep it charged.

20
00:01:52,660 --> 00:01:55,140
These distractions can't be coincidences.

21
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:05,740
You never eat.

22
00:02:05,820 --> 00:02:06,980
How do you make it all night?

23
00:02:07,760 --> 00:02:09,000
It's not that bad.

24
00:02:10,220 --> 00:02:12,900
Um, was that our patient who just went out the front door?

25
00:02:13,540 --> 00:02:14,840
No, he ran.

26
00:02:15,160 --> 00:02:16,200
Our patient's injured.

27
00:02:17,480 --> 00:02:18,440
Xiaolin was right.

28
00:02:19,220 --> 00:02:20,080
Stay calm.

29
00:02:20,780 --> 00:02:22,700
The past will be just as it was.

30
00:02:23,480 --> 00:02:24,620
A lot could have happened.

31
00:02:25,760 --> 00:02:27,360
But Lu Guang made a choice.

32
00:02:27,360 --> 00:02:29,720
And now that choice is fate.

33
00:02:32,020 --> 00:02:32,900
Past or future?

34
00:02:33,540 --> 00:02:34,660
Remain untouched.

35
00:02:34,660 --> 00:02:49,040
Love is real.

36
00:02:49,040 --> 00:02:49,320
Omg...

